  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of loans for construction of 17,000 housing units and 10,000 home loans for first-time home ownership for the poor bankable families in Bihar, Madhya Pradesh, Orissa, Uttar Pradesh,Rajasthan, Jharkhand, Chhattisgarh and West Bengal.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provision of loans for construction of 17,000 housing units and 10,000 home loans for first-time home ownership for the poor bankable families in Bihar, Madhya Pradesh, Orissa, Uttar Pradesh,Rajasthan, Jharkhand, Chhattisgarh and West Bengal. is a component of Financing Liveable Habitat for Poor in Low Income States reported by FCDO with a funding type of 113 - Other and a budget of &#xA3;40,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Urban development and management, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development.</narrative>
  </description>
